//RS     /// outside that loop (heterogeneous elements, boxing is disallowed), so any
//RS     /// other reference — a bare read, `.len()`, indexing, a second loop, passing
//RS     /// it to another call, use inside a nested block (`#Unsafe { }`, `if`, …) —
//RS     /// is E1314. v1 scope, matching the plan's "conservative v1" call for this
//RS     /// card: exactly the shape the ballot's own `log_all` example needs.
